 "summary": "Open-source authorization policy language from AWS (used by Amazon Verified Permissions and AWS Verified Access): permit/forbid policies over principal, action, resource and context with when/unless conditions, entity hierarchies, schemas for validation, templates, and a Lean-formalized semantics designed for SMT-based analysis.",
 "status": "active",
